{
  "title": "CCL-F Commitment Agent — Therac-25",
  "description": "Real-time observability for the CCL-F commitment state machine. Traces LangGraph node execution, ACS probability distribution, ACO detection events, and audit chain integrity.",
  "widgets": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "ACS Probability Distribution Over Time",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "avg:cclf.acs.snapshot{cclf.acs.state:open}",
            "display_type": "line",
            "style": { "palette": "green" },
            "metadata": [{ "expression": "avg:cclf.acs.snapshot{cclf.acs.state:open}", "alias_name": "p(OPEN)" }]
          },
          {
            "q": "avg:cclf.acs.snapshot{cclf.acs.state:trajectory}",
            "display_type": "line",
            "style": { "palette": "yellow" },
            "metadata": [{ "expression": "avg:cclf.acs.snapshot{cclf.acs.state:trajectory}", "alias_name": "p(TRAJECTORY)" }]
          },
          {
            "q": "avg:cclf.acs.snapshot{cclf.acs.state:authority}",
            "display_type": "line",
            "style": { "palette": "orange" },
            "metadata": [{ "expression": "avg:cclf.acs.snapshot{cclf.acs.state:authority}", "alias_name": "p(AUTHORITY)" }]
          },
          {
            "q": "avg:cclf.acs.snapshot{cclf.acs.state:execution}",
            "display_type": "line",
            "style": { "palette": "red" },
            "metadata": [{ "expression": "avg:cclf.acs.snapshot{cclf.acs.state:execution}", "alias_name": "p(EXECUTION)" }]
          }
        ],
        "yaxis": { "min": "0", "max": "1" },
        "markers": [
          { "value": "y = 0.7", "display_type": "warning dashed", "label": "ACO C1 threshold" }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "definition": {
        "type": "query_value",
        "title": "ACO Detections (Session)",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "sum:cclf.aco.detections{*}.as_count()",
            "aggregator": "sum",
            "conditional_formats": [
              { "comparator": ">", "value": 0, "palette": "red_on_white" },
              { "comparator": "=", "value": 0, "palette": "green_on_white" }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "autoscale": true,
        "precision": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Node Execution Duration (ms)",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "avg:cclf.node.duration_ms{*} by {cclf.node}",
            "display_type": "bars"
          }
        ],
        "markers": [
          { "value": "y = 5000", "display_type": "warning dashed", "label": "5s SLO" }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Commitment State Transitions",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "sum:cclf.transitions.total{cclf.transition.outcome:applied}.as_count()",
            "display_type": "bars",
            "style": { "palette": "green" },
            "metadata": [{ "expression": "sum:cclf.transitions.total{cclf.transition.outcome:applied}.as_count()", "alias_name": "Applied" }]
          },
          {
            "q": "sum:cclf.transitions.total{cclf.transition.outcome:blocked}.as_count()",
            "display_type": "bars",
            "style": { "palette": "red" },
            "metadata": [{ "expression": "sum:cclf.transitions.total{cclf.transition.outcome:blocked}.as_count()", "alias_name": "Blocked" }]
          },
          {
            "q": "sum:cclf.transitions.total{cclf.transition.outcome:rejected_human}.as_count()",
            "display_type": "bars",
            "style": { "palette": "orange" },
            "metadata": [{ "expression": "sum:cclf.transitions.total{cclf.transition.outcome:rejected_human}.as_count()", "alias_name": "Rejected (human)" }]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "definition": {
        "type": "timeseries",
        "title": "Evidence Admissible Ratio",
        "requests": [
          {
            "q": "avg:cclf.evidence.admissible_ratio_obs{*}",
            "display_type": "line",
            "style": { "palette": "cool" }
          }
        ],
        "yaxis": { "min": "0", "max": "1" },
        "markers": [
          { "value": "y = 0.5", "display_type": "info dashed", "label": "Admissibility threshold" }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "definition": {
        "type": "note",
        "content": "## CCL-F Therac-25 Dashboard\n\nThis dashboard monitors the CCL-F commitment agent running the Therac-25 case study (1985–1987).\n\n**ACS Distribution**: probability over the four commitment states (OPEN → TRAJECTORY → AUTHORITY → EXECUTION). When p(TRAJECTORY) > 0.7 while formal state = OPEN, C1 ACO condition is active.\n\n**transition_guard** node should always be the fastest — it's LLM-free by design. Unexplained latency on that node warrants investigation.\n\nAudit chain entries are forwarded as logs. Verify `entry_hash` chain continuity in Logs → `source:cclf.audit`.",
        "background_color": "white",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "left",
        "show_tick": false
      }
    }
  ],
  "layout_type": "ordered",
  "notify_list": [],
  "reflow_type": "fixed",
  "tags": ["service:cclf-therac25", "team:cclf"]
}
